{"id": "70274", "title": "睡睡有今朝", "author": "水尧儿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 7, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70274/70274s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70274.htm", "intro": "睡睡是个小迷糊妞，今朝是个大灰狼爷们——某一日大灰狼趁睡睡发烧迷糊把她吃掉了。\n    可怜的睡睡也在不久之后因为不是XX而被男友抛弃，她才知道自己早就失了身，罪魁祸首就是自己的哥们儿今朝！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70274", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "10917341.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10917342.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10917343.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10917344.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10917345.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-58", "file": "10917346.html", "available": true}, {"title": "番外", "file": "10917347.html", "available": true}]}